    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arisen Force: Vonimir</strong>  is an A-RPG game featuring exquisite <strong>high-definition pixels</strong> ,it combines the engaging RPG adventure storyline  with the Stylish Actional combat experience.We create a magnificent Middle-Earth world, for players exploration and adventure, recruit teammates, challenge enemies, reveal the secrets of the world, guide the future, forge your own legends .</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/80aa76aa119e3c690b40d901abae61f8.poster.avif?t=1752727984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/80aa76aa119e3c690b40d901abae61f8.webm?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/80aa76aa119e3c690b40d901abae61f8.mp4?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/4668da199363913e0925cbd5ba4fae27.poster.avif?t=1752727984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/4668da199363913e0925cbd5ba4fae27.webm?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/4668da199363913e0925cbd5ba4fae27.mp4?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9e7bd655a6a31aaf1899b7b3a3d0a3f5.poster.avif?t=1752727984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9e7bd655a6a31aaf1899b7b3a3d0a3f5.webm?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9e7bd655a6a31aaf1899b7b3a3d0a3f5.mp4?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9a2faebac649edec302caccee648c708.poster.avif?t=1752727984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9a2faebac649edec302caccee648c708.webm?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/9a2faebac649edec302caccee648c708.mp4?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/901627de51ed0244cdc14b0889477ccc.poster.avif?t=1752727984\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/901627de51ed0244cdc14b0889477ccc.webm?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/901627de51ed0244cdc14b0889477ccc.mp4?t=1752727984\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><strong>Features</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A magnificent fantasy world for players to explore, develop and other interesting experiences.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Exquisite HD pixel style and ingenuity hand-painted, experience picturesque play art style.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >From remote villages to magnificent castles, from desolate deserts to silver ice sheets, enjoy the vast and distinctive landscapes.<br>        </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In a chaotic world, interact with all forces and write your own epic chapter.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth action strategy combat with rich skill modules,and it can instantly switch teammate anytime,\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >challenging the World BOSS , the ultimate path will always be left to the Warriors.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than eight kinds of unique weapon modules,it will continue to be enriched with the follow-up development.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free kit system of weapons and skills,it's Ok to be a mage wielding a giant sword, or a hunter who tanks the enemy, interesting and powerful.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and recruit teammates, build  them with unique equipment and skills for your exclusive forces.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to adventure, there are taverns, forging, trade and other activities as travel seasoning.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the basis of the world outlook, we add some linked characters makes the game journey more interesting and full of surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/33e6953a68a6c26b2d814564787d864b.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/5351afd428e064f997fbc0fc52c7d610.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/bb4624a7c94b8c986d25f2170591f9d7.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span></p>",
