b_paragraph\" >In a chaotic world, interact with all forces and write your own epic chapter.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Smooth action strategy combat with rich skill modules,and it can instantly switch teammate anytime,\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >challenging the World BOSS , the ultimate path will always be left to the Warriors.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than eight kinds of unique weapon modules,it will continue to be enriched with the follow-up development.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A free kit system of weapons and skills,it's Ok to be a mage wielding a giant sword, or a hunter who tanks the enemy, interesting and powerful.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rescue and recruit teammates, build  them with unique equipment and skills for your exclusive forces.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition to adventure, there are taverns, forging, trade and other activities as travel seasoning.\t</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On the basis of the world outlook, we add some linked characters makes the game journey more interesting and full of surprises.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/33e6953a68a6c26b2d814564787d864b.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/5351afd428e064f997fbc0fc52c7d610.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2359660/extras/bb4624a7c94b8c986d25f2170591f9d7.avif?t=1752727984\" /></span></p>",
